  "html": "<h2 id=\"1180261027-2026-11-02\"><a href=\"#1180261027-2026-11-02\">1.18.0+261027 (2026-11-02)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features\"><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add audit logging to federation requests (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/cc3d1e4b97605e08bd13d1d05077e9d379cfd323\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cc3d1e4</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>federation:</strong> ensure outgoing connections (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/ea6f26464a6eea2e8d692f941b3f387fdc6a855b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ea6f264</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>federation:</strong> configure trusted CAs and groups (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/567b3ba418ccbf31ae4ecb7b5963395044ad5fbb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">567b3ba</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>federation:</strong> validate peers and intermediate CAs (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/6c70df7702e6cb3253b73ef100d153455c8f94f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6c70df7</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"fixes\"><a href=\"#fixes\">Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ui:</strong> patch vulnerable Vite and Undici (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/6c208553c9825c96fe32161a91a953f55e405ffc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">6c20855</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ui:</strong> generate federation route types (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/2efc432b8e3f1e3ba29f4bf5de1873549b356642\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2efc432</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-changes\"><a href=\"#other-changes\">Other changes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ui:</strong> update compatible dependencies (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-tak-rmapi/commit/3b85d9824d0eeb91a59de933e7e2385094f53b99\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3b85d98</a>)</li>\n</ul>"
